                 lower bound      moves 8·ni·nj·nk/√M − M            (HBL, σ = 3/2, CDKSY 2013)   gap 2896× if ≈ 16·nj ≥ M; 1448× if ≈ 8·nj·nk ≥ M and ≈ 16·nj < M at M = 2 MiB, B = 64
                 lower bound      moves 8·nj·nk + 8·ni·nk + 8·ni·nj  (footprint, every distinct element crosses once)   gap 1× if ≈ 8·nj·nk < M at M = 2 MiB, B = 64
                 footprint        c: [0, 8·ni·nj)  a: [0, 8·ni·nk)  b: [0, 8·nj·nk)   resident after if ≈ 8·nj·nk + 8·ni·nk + 8·ni·nj < M
